  "items": [
    {
      "source": "When <code>@Valid</code> is declared on a container of elements such as\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a>, and others, this method returns the container\nof the validated <a href=\"#getArgument()\"><code>argument</code></a>, while\n<a href=\"#getContainerIndex()\"><code>getContainerIndex()</code></a> and <a href=\"#getContainerKey()\"><code>getContainerKey()</code></a> provide\ninformation about the index or key if applicable.",
      "translation": "当在元素容器（如<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a>等）上声明<code>@Valid</code>时，此方法返回包含已验证的<a href=\"#getArgument()\"><code>argument</code></a>的容器，而<a href=\"#getContainerIndex()\"><code>getContainerIndex()</code></a>和<a href=\"#getContainerKey()\"><code>getContainerKey()</code></a>则提供（如适用）索引或键的信息。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "When <code>@Valid</code> is declared on an indexed container of elements such as\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> or array, this method returns the index of the validated\n<a href=\"#getArgument()\"><code>argument</code></a>.",
      "translation": "当在索引容器（如 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 或数组）的元素上声明了 `<code>@Valid` 时，此方法返回已验证的 <a href=\"#getArgument()\"><code>argument</code></a> 的索引。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "When <code>@Valid</code> is declared on a container of elements referenced by\nkey such as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, this method returns the key of the\nvalidated <a href=\"#getArgument()\"><code>argument</code></a>.",
      "translation": "当在通过键引用的元素容器（如<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>）上声明<code>@Valid</code>时，此方法返回已验证的<a href=\"#getArgument()\"><code>argument</code></a>的键。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "When the method parameter is a container such as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>, array,\nor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, then a separate <a href=\"ParameterValidationResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterValidationResult</code></a>\nis created for each element with errors. In that case, the properties\n<a href=\"#getContainer()\"><code>container</code></a>, <a href=\"#getContainerIndex()\"><code>containerIndex</code></a>,\nand <a href=\"#getContainerKey()\"><code>containerKey</code></a> provide additional context.",
      "translation": "当方法参数是容器（如<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>）、数组或<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>）时，会为每个具有错误的元素创建一个单独的<a href=\"ParameterValidationResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterValidationResult</code></a>。在这种情况下，属性<a href=\"#getContainer()\"><code>container</code></a>、<a href=\"#getContainerIndex()\"><code>containerIndex</code></a>和<a href=\"#getContainerKey()\"><code>containerKey</code></a>提供额外的上下文信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "List of <a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a> representations adapted from the\nvalidation errors of the validation library.\n<ul>\n<li>For a constraints directly on a method parameter, error codes are\nbased on the names of the constraint annotation, the object, the method,\nthe parameter, and parameter type, for example,\n<code>[\"Max.myObject#myMethod.myParameter\", \"Max.myParameter\", \"Max.int\", \"Max\"]</code>.\nArguments include the parameter itself as a <a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a>, for example,\n<code>[\"myObject#myMethod.myParameter\", \"myParameter\"]</code>, followed by actual\nconstraint annotation attributes (i.e. excluding \"message\", \"groups\" and\n\"payload\") in alphabetical order of attribute names.\n</li><li>For cascaded constraints via <code>@Valid</code>\non a bean method parameter, this method returns\n<a href=\"../FieldError.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>field errors</code></a> that you\ncan also access more conveniently through methods of the\n<a href=\"ParameterErrors.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterErrors</code></a> sub-class.\n</li></ul>",
      "translation": "由验证库的验证错误适配而来的 <a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a> 表示列表。\n<ul>\n<li>对于直接应用于方法参数的约束，错误代码基于约束注解、对象、方法、参数和参数类型的名称，例如，<code>[\"Max.myObject#myMethod.myParameter\", \"Max.myParameter\", \"Max.int\", \"Max\"]</code>。参数包括作为 <a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a> 的参数本身，例如，<code>[\"myObject#myMethod.myParameter\", \"myParameter\"]</code>，随后按属性名称字母顺序排列实际的约束注解属性（即不包括 \"message\"、\"groups\" 和 \"payload\"）。\n</li><li>对于通过 <code>@Valid</code> 在 Bean 方法参数上进行的级联约束，此方法返回 <a href=\"../FieldError.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>field errors</code></a>，您也可以通过 <a href=\"ParameterErrors.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterErrors</code></a> 子类的更便捷地访问这些错误。\n</li></ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "List of <a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a> representations adapted from the\nvalidation errors of the validation library.",
      "translation": "由验证库的验证错误转换而来的 `<a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a>` 表示列表。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>ParameterValidationResult</code>.",
