    {
      "source": "Nested validation errors on an Object method parameter are exposed as\n<a href=\"../Errors.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Errors</code></a> by the subclass\n<a href=\"ParameterErrors.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterErrors</code></a>.",
      "translation": "嵌套验证错误在 Object 方法参数上，由子类 <a href=\"ParameterErrors.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterErrors</code></a> 作为 <a href=\"../Errors.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Errors</code></a> 暴露。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Validation errors directly on method parameter values are exposed as a\nlist of <a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "方法参数值上的验证错误以 `<a href=\"../../context/MessageSourceResolvable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceResolvable</code></a>` 列表形式暴露。",
      "count": 2
